      "<span style=\"color:#FF756E\">Overrideable</span>\r\nOverride this function to check conditions that determine if the class should load."
    ],
    [
      "<code style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#4EC9B0\">UKSaveGame</span><span style=\"color:#D4D4D4\">* </span><span style=\"color:#DCDCAA\">GetSaveData</span><span style=\"color:#D4D4D4\">()</span></span></code>",
      "<span style=\"color:#FF756E\">BlueprintCallable</span>\r\nCalls this function to get the currently loaded save game in the <a href='/Documentation/Pages/UnrealEngine/#SaveManagerSubsystem'>SaveManagerSubsystem</a>."
